<p>In 2000, Nicchio worked at <strong>PSINet</strong>, an international internet infrastructure and hosting company, in commercial work related to <strong>Corporate Hosting</strong>. It marked a shift from the internet as a field of personal exploration to the internet as a professional market as well.</p>
